    {
      "text": "“Jorge is a visionary leader, whose humanity shines bright and inspires all those around him.”\nMihai Pohonţu\nCEO of Amber",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“The heart and soul of Game Development in Mexico. He leads by inspiring others.”\nBradd McBrearty\nCreative Director (Ex-Apple, Disney, EA)",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Amazing gaming veteran who leads by example. Always guided by kind soul and sharp instincts.”\nVlad Popovici\nCOO | Tech Leader | Board Member",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“One of these rare people that can create something out of nothing, anytime, anywhere.”\nBogdan Constantinescu\nHead of Product & Innovation",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Persistence beats resistance. If I know someone who definitely does not give up, it is Jorge.”\nAlvaro Jauregui\nConcept Artist | Visual Developer (AAA)",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Dynamic, visionary, and inspiring. One of the most remarkable professionals.”\nMihaela Duță\nIT Project Manager",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“He's pure energy. Working with Jorge is akin to working with the Duracell Teddy bear.”\nGwenael Heliou\nRegional GM @ Kabam",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Instrumental to Amber's international presence. His positive attitude made this possible.”\nVlad Anghelahar\nHead of Engineering at Amber",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“The living example of Kaizen. Always looking for a way of improving whatever he is working on.”\nAlberto Ramírez\nGame Designer",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Extraordinary person. Maintains a personal touch, helping you feel valued and heard.”\nStone Perales\nSenior Art Director",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Charisma and a great sparkle to ignite fire into projects. I am happy to consider him my friend.”\nHector Padilla Perez\nDirector of Engineering",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
      "text": "“Persistence and determination to achieve goals are truly inspiring. Sharing is caring.”\nAbraham Lara\n3D Animation Director",
      "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/yorgenmeister/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0"
    },
    {
