    {
      "text": "2004 - PRESENT\nKaraOkulta / KOGameStudios\n\nWe founded the studio that set a milestone in the national industry by becoming the first Jalisco studio to be acquired by an international firm (Amber).\n\nVisit Site →",
      "href": "https://www.karaokulta.com/"
    },
    {
      "text": "2015 - PRESENT\nSparkplug Technologies\n\nA creative services subscription (not retail software, not a game studio). Revolutionizing the industry with Creative Services as a Subscription. We offer software development, AAA art, and VFX under a flexible and scalable model.\n\nVisit Site →",
      "href": "https://getsparkplug.com/"
    },
    {
      "text": "2019 - PRESENT\nAmber Mexico\n\nAfter the acquisition, we drove the studio's growth from 20 to 200+ artisans, overseeing strategic operations and expanding AAA influence in the region.\n\nVisit Site →",
      "href": "https://amberstudio.com/location-guadalajara"
    },
    {
      "text": "2021 - PRESENT\nUETC (U-Echo Training Center)\n\nFounded to professionalize the industry and scale talent to AAA standards. We are the only Epic Games authorized center in Mexico focused on Unreal Engine. UETC is not UNITEC: it is the U-Echo Training Center, an Unreal Engine training center.\n\nVisit Site →",
      "href": "https://uetc.mx/"
    },
    {
      "text": "2026 - PRESENT\nTecni Moto Garage\n\nFounding partner with my uncle. Motorcycle shop in Acoxpa, Mexico City. We will open on November 1, 2026.\n\nVisit Site →",
      "href": "https://tecnimoto.jorgefsb.workers.dev/"
    },
